    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "Normally, a ritual bound to a "
        },
        {
          "text": "Practitioner's Pouch",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " needs all of the necessary items within itself. When sewn onto a "
        },
        {
          "text": "Practitioner's Pouch",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ", a "
        },
        {
          "text": "Rift Patch",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " allows a ritual to search for missing items within the user's Rift storage instead. If necessary items are contained both in the Pouch and the Rift, "
        },
        {
          "text": "items in the Rift will be consumed first",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    }
